When you have connected to code-server
In the left bar find the extension icon:
In the search bar search for YAML Language Support by RedHat and install.
Open a terminal on your control host and edit the following file:
~/.local/share/code-server/User/settings.json
This file already contains:
{
    "security.workspace.trust.untrustedFiles": "open",
    "redhat.telemetry.enabled": true
}

underneath add the following:

{
  "yaml.validation": true,
  "yaml.format.enable": true,
  "yaml.yamlVersion": "1.2"
}

Save the file and restart code-server.
systemctl restart code-server@$USER

